  title: Signal on the Ridge
  description: A lookout spots movement on a far ridge and asks whether the caravan can spare supplies for a faster warning run.
  options:
  - label: Share the warning route
    outcomeText: The lookout points out a safer line of travel and the caravan regains some confidence.
